@startuml Box Lifecycle

title Box lifecycle
caption Target design. Boxes and donations: Box lifecycle. Decisions O22, D3, D1, O2, O5, O8, O9, O24, O28. ADRs 0011, 0015.

state "Expected" as Expected : ordered or mailed in;\nentering it early is optional (O22)
state "Arrived" as Arrived : at a hub; may be in a bay
state "Composed" as Composed : built at the hub from\nseveral donations (optional)
state "Attested" as Attested : verified, weighed, sized, signed;\nQR label issued; contents fixed
state "Allocated" as Allocated : on a vehicle of a convoy
state "Departed" as Departed : the vehicle has left
state "Delivered" as Delivered : marked arrived by the\nConvoy Leader or Dispatcher
state "Accepted" as Accepted : Ukrainian customs accepted\nits goods list
state "Seized" as Seized : kept by customs
state "Returned to hub" as Returned : refused, sent back to a\nregistered hub the leader chose
state "Undeliverable" as Undeliverable : damaged or stolen,\nwith a reason
state "Void" as Void : replaced by a new box (D3)

[*] --> Expected : donor announced it
[*] --> Arrived : entered on arrival
Expected --> Arrived : checked in at a hub
Arrived --> Composed : combine donations
Composed --> Attested : Loader attests
Arrived --> Attested : Loader attests\n[no expired item]
Attested --> Allocated : allocated to a vehicle\n[Receiver registered]
Allocated --> Attested : allocation removed
Allocated --> Allocated : moved to another vehicle\n(declarations go stale)
Allocated --> Departed : convoy departs

Departed --> Delivered : arrived
Delivered --> Accepted : goods list accepted (O24)
Departed --> Seized : customs keep it
Departed --> Returned : customs send it back
Departed --> Undeliverable : damaged or stolen
Returned --> Arrived : back at the hub,\nlabel and contents unchanged (O28)

Attested --> Void : replaced
Allocated --> Void : replaced
Arrived --> Void : replaced

Accepted --> [*]
Seized --> [*]
Undeliverable --> [*]
Void --> [*]

note right of Attested
  An attested box is never edited or deleted.
  A change means replacement (Void + a new box).
end note

note bottom of Allocated
  "Declared" is not a stored state: whether a box's
  declarations are current is derived from the
  vehicle's declaration snapshots.
end note

@enduml
